<mxCell id="t1" value="&lt;b&gt;[Task 1] scan_excel_files&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;INPUT: EXCEL_INPUT_PATH | EXCEL_FILE_PATTERN&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;PROSES:&lt;br/&gt;- scan_excel_files(directory, pattern=&quot;echotik_data_*.xlsx&quot;)&lt;br/&gt;- Exclude subfolder: processed/, failed/&lt;br/&gt;- Sort alphabetical untuk konsistensi&lt;br/&gt;- Jika tidak ada file -&gt; raise AirflowSkipException&lt;br/&gt;- Generate run_id (YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS)&lt;br/&gt;- Kirim Discord: Ingestion Started + daftar file&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;OUTPUT (XCom): {files: [path1, path2, ...], run_id, start_time}" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="180" width="570" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="t2" value="&lt;b&gt;[Task 2] validate_db_connection&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;INPUT: Airflow Variable DB_CONNECTION_STRING&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;PROSES:&lt;br/&gt;- get_db_hook() -&gt; EchotikDBHook(conn_str)&lt;br/&gt;- db.test_connection() -&gt; SELECT 1&lt;br/&gt;- db.check_tables_exist(PRODUCTION_TABLES)&lt;br/&gt;  Target: regions, influencers, videos_echotik, hashtags_echotik,&lt;br/&gt;          video_metrics_snapshot, bi_video_revenue_summary, dll&lt;br/&gt;- db.check_tables_exist(STAGING_TABLES)&lt;br/&gt;  Target: videos_echotik_staging, hashtags_echotik_staging,&lt;br/&gt;          video_metrics_snapshot_staging&lt;br/&gt;- db.check_tables_exist([ingest_audit_log])&lt;br/&gt;- Jika tabel kurang -&gt; raise Exception&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;OUTPUT (XCom): {status: valid}" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="355" width="570" height="195" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="t3" value="&lt;b&gt;[Task 3] tagging_category_name&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;INPUT: XCom files (task1) | ML Service (http://host.docker.internal:8001) | CATEGORY_RULES&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;PROSES (per file Excel):&lt;br/&gt;- Baca 3 sheet: video_library, video_selling, hashtags&lt;br/&gt;- Tag video_library: classify_text(title_full, title_brief, hashtags)&lt;br/&gt;  1. Coba POST ke ML service /ml/predict/category (timeout 2s)&lt;br/&gt;  2. Fallback: rule-based keyword scoring (CATEGORY_RULES)&lt;br/&gt;     - Title match: +1.5 per keyword | Brief match: +1.0 per keyword&lt;br/&gt;     - Kategori tertinggi menang | Score 0 -&gt; &quot;Lifestyle &amp; Home&quot;&lt;br/&gt;- Tag video_selling: classify_text(title_full, title_brief)&lt;br/&gt;- Tag hashtags: mapping dari hasil tagging video_library&lt;br/&gt;  (majority vote per hashtag -&gt; best category)&lt;br/&gt;- Write back ke Excel in-place (overwrite file asli)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;OUTPUT (XCom): {tagged_files: int}" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="565" width="570" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="t4" value="&lt;b&gt;[Task 4] read_and_load_staging&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;INPUT: XCom files+run_id | BATCH_SIZE | EchotikDBHook&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;PROSES (per file Excel):&lt;br/&gt;- read_excel_sheets(filepath, [video_library, hashtags, video_selling])&lt;br/&gt;- Video Library:&lt;br/&gt;  standardize_video_library_columns() -&gt; data_source=library&lt;br/&gt;  add_ingest_metadata(run_id, source_file)&lt;br/&gt;- Video Selling:&lt;br/&gt;  standardize_video_selling_columns() -&gt; data_source=shop&lt;br/&gt;  add_ingest_metadata(run_id, source_file)&lt;br/&gt;- Hashtags:&lt;br/&gt;  standardize_hashtag_columns()&lt;br/&gt;  add_ingest_metadata(run_id, source_file)&lt;br/&gt;- build_snapshot_records_from_videos() -&gt; 1 snapshot per video&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;BULK INSERT ke Staging (truncate_first=True, batch_size=100):&lt;br/&gt;  load_videos_to_staging() -&gt; videos_echotik_staging&lt;br/&gt;  load_hashtags_to_staging() -&gt; hashtags_echotik_staging&lt;br/&gt;  load_snapshots_to_staging() -&gt; video_metrics_snapshot_staging&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;OUTPUT (XCom): {videos_inserted, hashtags_inserted, snapshots_inserted, selling_records}" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="790" width="570" height="250" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="t5" value="&lt;b&gt;[Task 5] validate_db_staging&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;INPUT: run_id (XCom) | EchotikDBHook&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;PROSES - validate_video_staging(db, run_id):&lt;br/&gt;- UPDATE is_valid=0 WHERE duplicate (keep MIN staging_id)&lt;br/&gt;- UPDATE is_valid=0 WHERE echotik_video_id IS NULL&lt;br/&gt;- UPDATE is_valid=0 WHERE published_at IS NULL&lt;br/&gt;- UPDATE is_valid=0 WHERE views_num &lt; 0&lt;br/&gt;- UPDATE is_valid=0 WHERE gmv_usd &lt; 0 OR total_gmv_amt_usd &lt; 0&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;PROSES - validate_hashtag_staging(db, run_id):&lt;br/&gt;- UPDATE is_valid=0 WHERE duplicate (keep MIN staging_id)&lt;br/&gt;- UPDATE is_valid=0 WHERE echotik_tag_id IS NULL&lt;br/&gt;- UPDATE is_valid=0 WHERE tag_title IS NULL&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;OUTPUT (XCom): {video_summary, hashtag_summary, total_valid, total_invalid}" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="1055" width="570" height="205" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="t6" value="&lt;b&gt;[Task 6] upsert_to_production&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;INPUT: run_id + selling_records (XCom) | EchotikDBHook&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;URUTAN UPSERT (FK dependency order):&lt;br/&gt;1. upsert_regions() -&gt; regions&lt;br/&gt;   INSERT DISTINCT dari hashtags_echotik_staging WHERE is_valid=1&lt;br/&gt;2. upsert_influencers() -&gt; influencers (ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE)&lt;br/&gt;   INSERT+UPDATE dari videos_echotik_staging WHERE is_valid=1&lt;br/&gt;   Computed: follower_tier (nano/micro/mid/macro/mega)&lt;br/&gt;3. upsert_videos() -&gt; videos_echotik (ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE)&lt;br/&gt;   Computed: published_day_of_week, published_hour&lt;br/&gt;4. upsert_video_categories() -&gt; video_category_tags&lt;br/&gt;   JOIN videos_echotik untuk mendapat video_pk&lt;br/&gt;5. upsert_hashtags() -&gt; hashtags_echotik (ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE)&lt;br/&gt;6. insert_video_metrics_snapshots() -&gt; video_metrics_snapshot (APPEND ONLY)&lt;br/&gt;   JOIN videos_echotik untuk mendapat video_pk&lt;br/&gt;7. upsert_products_and_links() -&gt; products + video_products&lt;br/&gt;   Parse products_json dari selling_records&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;OUTPUT (XCom): {regions, influencers, videos, categories, hashtags, snapshots, products}" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="1275" width="570" height="255" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="t7" value="&lt;b&gt;[Task 7] refresh_bi_summary  [all_done]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Jika AUTO_REFRESH_BI=False -&gt; skip&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- TRUNCATE bi_video_revenue_summary&lt;br/&gt;- INSERT dari JOIN video_metrics_snapshot&lt;br/&gt;  (latest snapshot per video)&lt;br/&gt;- Computed: revenue_tier (top/high/medium/low)&lt;br/&gt;- TRUNCATE bi_hashtag_revenue_summary&lt;br/&gt;- INSERT dari hashtags_echotik&lt;br/&gt;- Discord: BI Summary Refreshed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEEEEE;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="1545" width="275" height="165" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="t8" value="&lt;b&gt;[Task 8] audit_log  [all_done]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Rekap statistik ke tabel ingest_audit_log:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- run_id, source_file&lt;br/&gt;- start_time, end_time, duration_sec&lt;br/&gt;- total/valid/invalid records&lt;br/&gt;- videos/hashtags inserted+updated&lt;br/&gt;- snapshots_inserted&lt;br/&gt;- influencers inserted+updated&lt;br/&gt;- status: SUCCESS" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEEEEE;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="975" y="1545" width="275" height="165" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="t9" value="&lt;b&gt;[Task 9] move_processed_files  [all_done]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Jika MOVE_PROCESSED_FILES=False -&gt; skip&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- Pindah setiap file Excel ke EXCEL_PROCESSED_PATH&lt;br/&gt;- Jika nama file sudah ada di processed/:&lt;br/&gt;  Append timestamp ke nama file&lt;br/&gt;- shutil.move(src, dst)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;OUTPUT (XCom): {moved: int, failed: int}" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="1725" width="570" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="t10" value="&lt;b&gt;[Task 10] cleanup_staging  [all_done]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Mode dari STAGING_CLEANUP:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- truncate_immediately:&lt;br/&gt;  TRUNCATE semua staging tables&lt;br/&gt;- keep_24h:&lt;br/&gt;  DELETE WHERE ingested_at &lt; NOW() - 1 DAY&lt;br/&gt;- keep_forever: skip" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="1880" width="570" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="t11" value="&lt;b&gt;[Task 11] ingest_complete_summary  [all_done]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;INPUT: XCom dari task1,4,5,6,9 | DiscordNotifier&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- Hitung durasi total (detik)&lt;br/&gt;- Hitung total_to_db = insert+update videos+categories+hashtags+snapshots&lt;br/&gt;- Kirim Discord: Final DAG Summary&lt;br/&gt;  (status, durasi, total records ke DB, breakdown per tipe)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;OUTPUT (XCom): {status: success}" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="2025" width="570" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
